;
; How Birdsong files a voice memo it keeps in the Hoard, in MYRA: the
; memo's number, its sample rate in hertz, its channels, its length in
; frames and when it was saved (Unix seconds). Birdsong asks whether the
; numbers fit before it lists them.
^ZXBIRDSONG(memo:i9) = rate:i5! ^ channels:i1! ^ frames:i9! ^ mtime:i12!
